              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Vikings have a hand weapon and shield. Close or Open Order. Shieldwall. Different weapons. May have light armour (+2), throwing spear (+2), javelins (+1) or two- handed axe (+3).</characteristic>
