              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Skirmishers have a hand weapon and javelins. Skirmishers. May exchange javelins for sling (free) or composite bow (+1) but there must be fewer skirmishers armed with composite bow than those armed with javelins and sling combined.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
